abstract: >-
  Agent Trust Gate™ is a local-first pre-action trust demonstrator for
  exact-action authority, Agent Standing, Verified Human Authority, GatePass
  evidence, refusal evidence, and separate execution evidence before a
  consequential AI-agent action.
